### Send a chat prompt to the Spring AI app

POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Say hello and the current date"
}

### Example with a different prompt

POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Summarize the benefits of Spring AI in one sentence."
}

### Notes
# - Start the Spring Boot app first (default port 8080).
# - In VS Code, install the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above a request to run it.
# - Response JSON will be of the form: { "content": "..." }
